`__filename` does not exist in ES modules, so once our `writeJsonFile` bundles the package into one,
creating the temporary file name threw a `ReferenceError`. A fixed string replaces it there; the name
stays unique per process, thread and call.

diff --git a/lib/index.js b/lib/index.js
